        "title": "Pashupatinath Temple",
        "text": "I love the hustle and bustle that surrounds a temple.  I love to see the devotion of the people and to experience a new culture and a new way of doing things.  I purchased an  offering before entering the grounds to the temple.  We didn't go in to the temple itself.  We stayed on the grounds and took pictures and then our guide helped us with a puja.  We then walked to the back side of the temple where the crematorium is located.  It was fascinating to watch the care and gentleness of those preparing bodies for cremation.  I loved being able to be a spectator and to have a small glimpse in to how a loved one is honored and prepared for a loving end from their worldly existence.",
